---
import PlacePage from '../components/PlacePage.astro';
---

<PlacePage
  lang="en"
  currentPath="/what-we-do"
  title="What we do"
  image="/places/bellas-artes.jpg"
  place="Palacio de Bellas Artes"
  country="Mexico"
  flag="mx"
  credit="Diego Delso, CC BY-SA 3.0"
  creditHref="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Palacio_de_Bellas_Artes,_M%C3%A9xico_D.F.,_M%C3%A9xico,_2013-10-13,_DD_40.jpg"
>
  <h1 slot="sheet">Three parts. One local presence.</h1>
  <p>Acquiring connects your volume to local acquirers in Latin America, at local prices. Where we have structure, local merchants are digitised from the company registration through the local entities, until payout. Settlement sends money collected locally to you in as few steps as possible.</p>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not take our clients' merchants. We do not dispute their accounts. We do not do fulfilment or shipping. Two niches, no conflict of interest.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#1C3D4A"></span>
      <h2><a href="/acquirers">Acquiring</a></h2>
      <p>Your volume, connected to local acquirers in Latin America: local prices and local payment methods.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#C2412D"></span>
      <h2>Local merchants</h2>
      <p>Digitisation where we have structure, from the company registration through the local entities, until payout.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#C4890A"></span>
      <h2>Settlement</h2>
      <p>Money collected locally reaches you in as few steps as possible. Nothing moves before the amounts match.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</PlacePage>
